id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix (Universal GSI)
version=v5.0
versionCode=9
author=Flint
description=Fixes broken network traffic indicator and per-UID network stats on Android 12-16 GSIs. v5.0 fixes critical BPF map name detection, removes dangerous setenforce 0 that caused boot loops on Infinity X/Huawei devices, adds targeted SELinux policies for netd BPF map access, and improves cross-device compatibility for EvoX, Infinity X, Axion OS, and other Treble GSIs.
